v2000-beyond-field-name as V2000: molfile saver: V2000 cannot hold the field name 'NNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN' of data S-group 1, longer than 30 characters
v2000-beyond-units as V2000: molfile saver: V2000 cannot hold the units 'UUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU' of data S-group 1, longer than 20 characters
v2000-beyond-data-line as V2000: molfile saver: V2000 cannot hold a line of the data of data S-group 1, longer than 200 characters
v2000-beyond-atom-coordinate as V2000: molfile saver: V2000 cannot hold the coordinate 100000.0000 of atom 2, outside the ten columns of a coordinate
v3000-beyond-bracket-coordinate as V2000: molfile saver: V2000 cannot hold the bracket coordinate -100000.0000 of S-group 1, outside the ten columns of a coordinate
