*** More S-groups than V2000 numbers ***
999 data S-groups in auto mode: V2000, 999 read back
999 data S-groups as V2000: written
1000 data S-groups in auto mode: V3000, 1000 read back
1000 data S-groups as V2000: molfile saver: V2000 cannot hold 1000 S-groups, more than the 999 their numbers reach
